623335", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6zf_Md5F9zgQ7kNvwEow9RG&_nc_oc=Ado2D2TOszCge8I_OWIlHQcM0KrfZQ8jbNcqcEitS0PAQxltvrKJy91PenMwS7iNfz0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMYN9PprL8MXkPmv7FmG1x5KnhdAOsn6YKkJpTiadGkEA&oe=6AE5EC62"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UzpYmYCqIyEQ7kNvwG3wMOX&_nc_oc=AdoQSwDaSsVrRJlUqbmOnzncxpAJkWe26E2E-Ljgy-uHJ0AllQN1z4SlE3FLA7kSnN4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOEWL2PNwT01UnOqRJ9dB0oC5RA-lecDzYtUJRjQyKa_g&oe=6AE5F9F3"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=niU9BJIzweoQ7kNvwFCLjl9&_nc_oc=Adrk9BnAiEXxhoZ9ZNRL4GOU3ZxrHih6nWVWdPDqOp7SJRX7n23ub77BVm0_cMT4LvI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO64EAwMjvsF9kksFtpZIp5dk5OvPiD4cnDtb0eKc5G-w&oe=6AE5EE6B"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636804263314_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ii8ZEFn9pXsQ7kNvwHb3QDi&_nc_oc=AdpXX91GTKEIGb1X9w8t53qIReFjOBk-PEvlk5EJ1xfStBz7pdz9_QJH6uqKFl7PUDA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOpBoEzo8guIpMIjkgMByLQG5J81eoH1-jXjY49R6THeQ&oe=6AE60BA2"}, {"file_name": "Icon 512x512-01.png", "id": "581195491100081", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568678_581195494433414_3254618470938933182_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eKOLB_iiBKIQ7kNvwEFxLFZ&_nc_oc=Adqgt0EtbDUWN1J5bGUfn4dseA1S_UvoLb1Okkj7zlQwOUzDdr6xf7NMKFAFGY4PJYU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNoRR_nuJ7chLflv87HYoZ0tXOam6jyG0P7cRZJ9o1jhg&oe=6AE60E3D"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape 1008x1440-01.png", "id": "480126738396124", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_480126745062790_195688056568553292